  "notes": "玻璃界面尊重降低透明度。\n\n- 在 iOS / macOS 打开「降低透明度」，或在 Windows 关闭「透明效果」后，底部导航、顶栏与顶部提示改为清晰的实色背景；更改系统设置后立即生效，无需重启应用。\n- 顶部提示在「增强对比度」下同样改为实色，更易阅读。\n- 界面组件库迁移到 Flutter 新的独立 Material / Cupertino 组件包，为官方即将弃用旧库做好准备；外观与操作保持不变。\n",
  "notesEn": "Glass now honours Reduce Transparency.\n\n- With Reduce Transparency on (iOS / macOS) or Transparency effects off (Windows), the bottom navigation, top bars and top notifications switch to a clear solid background. Changing the system setting takes effect immediately, without restarting the app.\n- Top notifications are also solid under Increase Contrast, so they are easier to read.\n- The interface moves to Flutter's new standalone Material and Cupertino packages ahead of the old libraries' deprecation; look and behaviour are unchanged.\n",
